(5840372, 848836, 1569, '<td valign="top">True there is graffiti in the pix, but not enough to make a statement. A close up of the one sign corner sort of pointing at something in the background would have been better.</td>', 'True there is graffiti in the pix, but not enough to make a statement. A close up of the one sign corner sort of pointing at something in the background would have been better.', '2010-01-28 11:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
