(5840391, 850124, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, perhaps you could have not chopped off the corner of the sign though. Minor quibble though.</td>', 'Nicely composed, perhaps you could have not chopped off the corner of the sign though. Minor quibble though.', '2010-01-28 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840392, 849321, 1569, '<td valign="top">The focus/sharpening needs tweaking, color may have really helped here.</td>', 'The focus/sharpening needs tweaking, color may have really helped here.', '2010-01-28 12:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840397, 849996, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow this place is a dream for this challenge. I''ve got a feeling the shot is tilting to the right slightly, and I really think you could have gone crazy with the contrast and saturation here.</td>', 'Wow this place is a dream for this challenge. I''ve got a feeling the shot is tilting to the right slightly, and I really think you could have gone crazy with the contrast and saturation here.', '2010-01-28 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840400, 850006, 1569, '<td valign="top">The building on the right needs to go, or cropping down to a point below the black hole on the upper left would have added more interest here.</td>', 'The building on the right needs to go, or cropping down to a point below the black hole on the upper left would have added more interest here.', '2010-01-28 12:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840418, 850021, 87252, '<td valign="top">Now this is MY kind of shot! I love the contrasts here; great tones from the BW conversion of the graffiti itself, then the tone difference between the wall and the pavement is nice too, and then there''s the contrast in the expressions of the subjects. Nice patch of light, well composed, my fave so far.</td>', 'Now this is MY kind of shot! I love the contrasts here; great tones from the BW conversion of the graffiti itself, then the tone difference between the wall and the pavement is nice too, and then there''s the contrast in the expressions of the subjects. Nice patch of light, well composed, my fave so far.', '2010-01-28 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840422, 849121, 87252, '<td valign="top">Poor tree! I hope Kerry is grateful!</td>', 'Poor tree! I hope Kerry is grateful!', '2010-01-28 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840424, 849511, 87252, '<td valign="top">C''est vachement belle! Cool subject.</td>', 'C''est vachement belle! Cool subject.', '2010-01-28 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840432, 849099, 87252, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here, I know you''ve used a deep DOF to get both elements in focus here, but I reckon this might have looked even cooler with just the foreground in sharp focus and the BG a blur. You could probably have got away with bumping up the saturation a bit too.</td>', 'I really like the composition here, I know you''ve used a deep DOF to get both elements in focus here, but I reckon this might have looked even cooler with just the foreground in sharp focus and the BG a blur. You could probably have got away with bumping up the saturation a bit too.', '2010-01-28 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840435, 849769, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great location, I like the processing, a more obvious focal point might have been nice though.</td>', 'Great location, I like the processing, a more obvious focal point might have been nice though.', '2010-01-28 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840438, 850120, 87252, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the electric meter, it gives the eye somewhere to rest after Texan flag. Not so sure about the edge of the bin poking out though.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the electric meter, it gives the eye somewhere to rest after Texan flag. Not so sure about the edge of the bin poking out though.', '2010-01-28 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840442, 850116, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow someone has a wicked imagination. I think you could perhaps have bumped the saturation a bit.</td>', 'Wow someone has a wicked imagination. I think you could perhaps have bumped the saturation a bit.', '2010-01-28 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840454, 850132, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, trash the dress always looks pretty cool. What I''ve found doing these before is that non-traditional poses actually work much better than standard bridal ones. Something a little more dynamic would probably have scored higher. Also the edge of her dress is ever so slightly chopped off, that''s a no no in the DPC composition playbook! Hope this helps.</td>', 'Nice idea, trash the dress always looks pretty cool. What I''ve found doing these before is that non-traditional poses actually work much better than standard bridal ones. Something a little more dynamic would probably have scored higher. Also the edge of her dress is ever so slightly chopped off, that''s a no no in the DPC composition playbook! Hope this helps.', '2010-01-28 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840465, 850041, 87252, '<td valign="top">I find this shot slightly confusing, on the one hand I really like the tones, nice contrasting black and whites, and I like the fact it''s not a straight shot of some graffiti like so many others in this challenge, however I don''t like the inclusion of the snow (?) and I think you could have shown more of the actually graffiti. Nice BW conversion though, suits the shot nicely.</td>', 'I find this shot slightly confusing, on the one hand I really like the tones, nice contrasting black and whites, and I like the fact it''s not a straight shot of some graffiti like so many others in this challenge, however I don''t like the inclusion of the snow (?) and I think you could have shown more of the actually graffiti. Nice BW conversion though, suits the shot nicely.', '2010-01-28 12:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840468, 850071, 87252, '<td valign="top">It is a chore for those of us blessed with enormous intellect! Nice shot, I might have cropped the top right corner out.</td>', 'It is a chore for those of us blessed with enormous intellect! Nice shot, I might have cropped the top right corner out.', '2010-01-28 12:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840470, 849781, 87252, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, nice imaginative use of the surroundings, and I like the purple toning.</td>', 'This is really cool, nice imaginative use of the surroundings, and I like the purple toning.', '2010-01-28 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840471, 850142, 48268, '<td valign="top">I think you should have shot this at a different time of day.</td>', 'I think you should have shot this at a different time of day.', '2010-01-28 12:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840474, 848867, 48268, '<td valign="top">I think someone spelled Narnia wrong...</td>', 'I think someone spelled Narnia wrong...', '2010-01-28 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
