(5841394, 849686, 112107, '<td valign="top">I think all B&amp;W would work better. The color is drawing too much attention to what isn''t hte best part of the subject.</td>', 'I think all B&W would work better. The color is drawing too much attention to what isn''t hte best part of the subject.', '2010-01-28 19:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
