(5841423, 849738, 112107, '<td valign="top">Finishing my voting in beauty. Another 9*.<br/>Perfect composition, great color &amp; contrast.</td>', 'Finishing my voting in beauty. Another 9*.Perfect composition, great color & contrast.', '2010-01-28 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841505, 849748, 112107, '<td valign="top">What can I say? This is the only 10* I gave in this challenge. The low saturation but high vibrancy are really beautiful.<br/>I love the warm tones, the layers, the texture, the subject, the composition. This is in a league of it''s own like <b>The Goose Lady</b><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=845031" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1149/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_845031.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1149/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_845031.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1149/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_845031.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I really really really hope you win because if you don''t, I''ll have to create a personal award!<br/>Best of luck!</td>', 'What can I say? This is the only 10* I gave in this challenge. The low saturation but high vibrancy are really beautiful.I love the warm tones, the layers, the texture, the subject, the composition. This is in a league of it''s own like The Goose Lady  I really really really hope you win because if you don''t, I''ll have to create a personal award!Best of luck!', '2010-01-28 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841509, 849939, 112107, '<td valign="top">Cheers Sarampo! <br/>There is no stopping you, man! This is another contender!!! :-O<br/>I''m just giving you 9* because the author survived it''s light piece.<br/> <br/>I can''t believe no one is scouting you for their team!</td>', 'Cheers Sarampo! There is no stopping you, man! This is another contender!!! :-OI''m just giving you 9* because the author survived it''s light piece. I can''t believe no one is scouting you for their team!', '2010-01-28 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
