(5843063, 850113, 59029, '<td valign="top">Love the look on the basketball player''s face, and I can''t tell if it''s a painted or real garbage can!  lovely fun shot, great capture, easy top 10. 9</td>', 'Love the look on the basketball player''s face, and I can''t tell if it''s a painted or real garbage can!  lovely fun shot, great capture, easy top 10. 9', '2010-01-29 10:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
