(5844325, 850090, 113278, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work at all for me. It is dull, poor lighting and you have a black area on the bottom right that could have easily been cropped out. I really hope you are trying to go for the brown, if not I am sorry but this doesn''t work for me at all.</td>', 'This doesn''t work at all for me. It is dull, poor lighting and you have a black area on the bottom right that could have easily been cropped out. I really hope you are trying to go for the brown, if not I am sorry but this doesn''t work for me at all.', '2010-01-30 09:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844331, 850099, 113278, '<td valign="top">A different angle or crop may have worked better here and I think blurring the background would also help to isolate the bench.</td>', 'A different angle or crop may have worked better here and I think blurring the background would also help to isolate the bench.', '2010-01-30 09:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844332, 850115, 113278, '<td valign="top">Sorry this just hurts my eyes to look at. I do see that you were being creative though but it seems like you just through this together. Quick snap shot, edit and send to dpc. There are likely viewers that love this style but for me it is a mess. Sorry.</td>', 'Sorry this just hurts my eyes to look at. I do see that you were being creative though but it seems like you just through this together. Quick snap shot, edit and send to dpc. There are likely viewers that love this style but for me it is a mess. Sorry.', '2010-01-30 09:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844333, 849738, 113278, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different angle to give this shop a little more pop would help. To me it just seems like a quick point and shoot at a meter can. Good luck though.</td>', 'Maybe a different angle to give this shop a little more pop would help. To me it just seems like a quick point and shoot at a meter can. Good luck though.', '2010-01-30 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844334, 849848, 113278, '<td valign="top">For me the sky is just too blown out. Also the front of the car is distracting, perhaps shooting from a different angle?</td>', 'For me the sky is just too blown out. Also the front of the car is distracting, perhaps shooting from a different angle?', '2010-01-30 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844336, 850144, 113278, '<td valign="top">That blown out area on the left really takes away from what this could be. It all seems very light and kinda bland.</td>', 'That blown out area on the left really takes away from what this could be. It all seems very light and kinda bland.', '2010-01-30 09:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844349, 849915, 100831, '<td valign="top">Now that''s just too funny... I''ll be back to see where this was taken.<br/>I''m not sure why, but I''m not loving the thick black frame even though I see it matches the outline of the artwork. Who knows, maybe it''s because grafitti is a kind of art that''s not meant to be framed and hung. Anyway, the colors are terrific and what a find!</td>', 'Now that''s just too funny... I''ll be back to see where this was taken.I''m not sure why, but I''m not loving the thick black frame even though I see it matches the outline of the artwork. Who knows, maybe it''s because grafitti is a kind of art that''s not meant to be framed and hung. Anyway, the colors are terrific and what a find!', '2010-01-30 10:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844350, 849748, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the composition, in general, but I wish you hadn''t tried to get rid of the gritty feeling (in the processing) because I think that''s the way grafitti looks best. 6</td>', 'I like the framing and the composition, in general, but I wish you hadn''t tried to get rid of the gritty feeling (in the processing) because I think that''s the way grafitti looks best. 6', '2010-01-30 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844353, 849536, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the light and colors of the sky in the background almost as much as the graftti and then.... well ... Nice catch!</td>', 'I like the light and colors of the sky in the background almost as much as the graftti and then.... well ... Nice catch!', '2010-01-30 10:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
