(5856759, 849121, 113324, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Digipixer:</b></div><hr/><i> The left side of this pix should be cropped out and a little more sharpening applied. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree with you on the sharpening, your comment made me go and learn sharpening properly.</td>', 'Originally posted by Digipixer: The left side of this pix should be cropped out and a little more sharpening applied.  I agree with you on the sharpening, your comment made me go and learn sharpening properly.', '2010-02-07 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
